  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\"><!-- .entry-header -->\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span> has released the Mains Exam Date for the post of Higher Judicial Service (HJS) Examination 2026. This recruitment was released for 16 posts. This recruitment has been issued for 27 posts. The online application process for Delhi High Court Higher Judicial Service HJS Recruitment 2026 were accepted from 01 July 2026, to 15 July 2026. The Mains Exam will be Conducted on 10-11 October 2026. Candidates who appeared in Pre examination can download their Delhi High Court Higher Judicial Service HJS Mains Exam Date 2026, which are given below.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">High Court of Delhi</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Delhi High Court Higher Judicial Service HJS Mains Exam Date 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>01 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>15 July 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>15 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; background-color: #ffffff;\">Pre Exam Date : <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>26 July 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Pre Admit Card Date : <strong>21 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key : <strong>28 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Pre Result : <strong>14 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt;\">Mains Exam Date : <strong>10-11 October 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General :<strong> Rs. 2000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST :<strong> Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Delhi High Court HJS Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>35 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>45 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per Delhi High Court HJS Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #0000ff; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Delhi High Court HJS 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 27 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 45.3387%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Category&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 45.3387%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Delhi Higher Judicial Service (HJS) Examination 2026</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">17</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">05</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.3306%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">05</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Delhi High Court HJS Recruitment 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates having Bachelor Degree in Law (LLB) in Any Recognized University in India will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have been practicing as an Advocate for not less than <strong>7 years</strong>&nbsp;as of the last date of application submission.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Delhi High Court HJS Online Form 2026 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Preliminary Examination</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Mains Examination</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Viva-Voce</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Delhi High Court Higher Judicial Service HJS Mains Exam Date 2026 : How To Download</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">In order to download their Mains Exam Date candidates are required to go to the important link section provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading their Mains Exam Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates need to provide their following details-:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Registration No. /Roll No.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>DOB/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Captcha Code(if specified)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After providing their details appropriately candidates will be able to check their Mains Exam Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can also check their Mains Exam Date from official site of the Delhi High Court.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow Sarkari Result on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Check Mains Exam Date Notice</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://delhihighcourt.nic.in/files/2026-09/recuritment/dhjs2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Download Pre Result</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://delhihighcourt.nic.in/files/2026-08/upload_shortlisted_